      "dedupe_key": "christopher-le-brun-minds-weather|2026-11-19|lisson",
      "description": "This November, Christopher Le Brun presents a new exhibition at Lisson Gallery London, expanding his ongoing inquiry into the formal possibilities of painting. His recent works develop modular compositions that range from singular canvases to expansive, intricately structured ensembles, including triptychs and monumental multi-part paintings. Together, these works push the boundaries of abstract pictorial form. Le Brun’s practice combines a masterful command of touch and colour with a deep engagement with art history, drawing on a rich array of visual, musical, and literary sources.",
